{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"xpath\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel>\n    <data id=\"count\" expr=\"0\"/>\n    <data id=\"done\" expr=\"false()\"/>\n    <data id=\"user\"><name xmlns=\"\">bob</name></data>\n  </datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <transition event=\"go\" cond=\"$cuont &gt; 3\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml056-xpath-undeclared-variable-typo.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":0,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":1},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml056-xpath-undeclared-variable-typo.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":5,"byteOffset":294,"endColumn":40,"endLine":8,"startColumn":35,"startLine":8},"insertedContent":{"text":"count"}}]}],"description":{"text":"use the declared variable `$count`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"warning","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml056-xpath-undeclared-variable-typo.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":40,"endLine":8,"startColumn":34,"startLine":8}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`$cuont` is not a declared XPath variable\n\n**Note:** an XPath variable exists only for a declared `<data id>` (and `<foreach item/index>` or `idlocation` names once they run) or a system variable; evaluating an undeclared one raises `error.execution`\n\n**Help:** did you mean `$count`?\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §5.10 System Variables\n\n**Spec:** SCXML CR 2014 §C.3.1 Data Model","text":"`$cuont` is not a declared XPath variable"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":299,"start":293},"category":"lint"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"in this `cond`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml056-xpath-undeclared-variable-typo.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":47,"endLine":8,"startColumn":34,"startLine":8}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML056"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"warning"},"fullDescription":{"text":"in the XPath data model a variable exists only for a declared `<data id>` (and a `<foreach item/index>` or `idlocation` name once it runs) or a system variable (`_event`, `_sessionid`, `_name`, `_ioprocessors`); evaluating any other `$name` fails, and SCXML 1.0 defines that outcome (§5.9.3: \"If a value expression does not return a legal data value, the SCXML Processor MUST place the error 'error.execution' in the internal event queue\"; a condition is then false, §5.9.1), so the document compiles. `.` is part of an XPath name, so `$user.name` is one undeclared variable, not a member access"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: use a declared variable (the finding suggests the nearest one), select a child with a path such as `$user/name`, or declare the variable with `<data id=\"name\"/>`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §5.9.3 Legal Data Values and Value Expressions\n\nRun `scx --explain SCXML056` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/#ValueExpressions","id":"SCXML056","name":"SCXML056","properties":{"category":"semantic"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an XPath expression references a variable the machine never declares"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}